the bridge could unfold are sealed; section `Unsealed` repeats the shape checks without the seal. -/

namespace RouteProbe

section Sealed
attribute [local irreducible] TCSlib.Cryptography.multiCom TCSlib.Cryptography.distAdv
  TCSlib.Cryptography.acceptProb Complexity.NUPPT.distinguisherL Complexity.NUPPT.coinLen
  Complexity.PolyExpr.eval TCSlib.Cryptography.ZK TCSlib.Cryptography.Protocol.viewV
